<title>UK: Bowthorpe to buy UK telecom/aerospace unit.</title>
<headline>Bowthorpe to buy UK telecom/aerospace unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronics group Bowthorpe Holdings Plc said on Tuesday it had signed a letter of intent to buy an unnamed British telecommunications and aerospace business for around 15 million stg.</p>
<p>Bowthorpe said the proposed deal needed completion of a statutory consultation process with the affected employees. It gave no further details but said a further announcement would be made in due course. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
